# Build output
dist/

# The staged publicDir. scripts/sync-native-assets.mjs wipes and refills it on
# every build and every dev server, from the wasm runtime, the SwiftF0 model
# and the manifest tier in native-assets.mjs. Keeping it out of git means one
# copy of each of those in the repository (the web app's public/ tree) rather
# than two that can drift — and nothing in here is ever worth editing.
.native-public/

# Superseded by .native-public/. Still ignored so a checkout that built this
# app before the move does not report its leftovers as untracked files.
public/

# Local TLS for device playtests over the LAN. Machine-specific, and a private key.
.dev-cert/

# NOTE: the generated native artefacts — ios/App/App/public,
# android/app/src/main/assets/public, capacitor.config.json, config.xml — are
# NOT listed here on purpose. Capacitor writes its own ios/.gitignore and
# android/.gitignore covering exactly those, and duplicating the rules here
# would give two files authority over one decision. Verified with
# `git check-ignore` after `cap add`.
